        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kū banhū ba mahanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno yenīyī, ū nene Paulo nalī ntungwa wa ng'wa Kilisito Yesu kūlwa nguno ying'we a bing'we banhū ba mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalisagīlwa ng'wagwigwa ū nīmo ūyo ninhwa kūlwa nguno ying'we; ū gwa kūshoolecha ī shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene nakakundūlīlwa, noolekejiwa mihayo ya mbisīla, gīt'ūmo nang'wandīkīlile mu shiguhī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kwīsoma ī yenīyī, mukūbūbona ū witegeleja bone ūmo nīmanīlile ī mbisīla ya ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yoi yalī ītamanīkile ū kū banhū ū mu shibyalīlwe ī sha kale, alīyo ī haha yafumbūlilwe ū kū batūng'wa na a bahangi bakwe beela, mu nzīla ya ng'wa Moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbisīla yene īlī gīkī, a banhū ba mahanga nabo balī na būsangī ū mu wingīji, nū mu mīlī; hama ū mulī Kilisito Yesu nabo banukūji ba wisagījiwa mu nzīla ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene hū nakīītwa kūbiza ntūmami wago ū nīmo gwenūyū, gīt'ūmo kalī kanong'hele ka shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu, īsho nakīlūkīlwa kūlenganīla na katūmamīle ka būdūla bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ī chene ū nene nalī ndo wa bado ū mu beela pye a bose, alīyo nakinhwa ū nīmo gwenūyū kūlwa shigongo, gīkī nabalomeele a banhū ba mahanga ī mhola ja būsabi bo ng'wa Kilisito, ūbo būkīlile kamanīlwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī nooleche ūmo īkūtūmamīlaga ī mbisīla yenīyo, īyo yalī ībisilwe kūfuma kale na kale mulī Mulungu, ūyo alī nseemi wa shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūhelilwe gīko kūlwa gīkī, ū ng'wikanza lya haha, ū wingī bo masala ga ng'wa Mulungu būmanīke mu nzīla ya kanisa, ū kū basugi na a batongeeji ba mu mapandī ga ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo kalī a kalongeje kakwe ka shiku jose, mhayo ūyo wagūshikīlīgije mulī Kilisito Yesu Seeba wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mulī we ū ng'wenūyo, tūlī na kwisandaala kūtaale, na tūdūgije kūshika ū kūlī Mulungu mu būshisha ng'holò kūlwa kūnzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nalīmulomba mutizūgwang'holò īkī nakūluhiagwa kūlwa nguno ying'we. Ī yose yenīyo īlī kūlw'ikūjo ling'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūwitegeleja būtogwa bo ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lūūlū kūlwa nguno ya mhayo gwenūyū, nakūntugījaga mazwi ū Sīswe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo shibyalīlwe shose shifumile kūlī we; ī shose īsho shilī ng'wigūlū nū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūnombaga gīkī ūmo būsabi w'ikūjo lyakwe, amuguzuhye na nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo wakwe ū mu būmunhū wing'we ū bo mu gatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kilisito ikale ū mung'holò jing'we kūlwa kūzunya; nīyo nakūmulombelaga gīkī mukome miji, ng'wīmīīle muhandakīle mu būtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musangīle nabo pye a beela ū kūwitegeleja ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Kilisito; ūmo būlī ū būgalī galī wabo, nū būlīhu, nū būgūngūhu, nū būshimu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwitegeleje ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Kilisito ūbo būliganije masala ga banhū; hama mushikanyiwe mu būshikanu bose bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū kūlī we ūyo adūgije kwīta būlī mhayo mu nzīla ya būdūla bo katūmamīle kakwe, kūkīla ūmo kalombele kise kalī, nūūlū ūmo tūkiganikīlaga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū kūlī we ū ng'wenūyo lībize ho ikūjo ū mu kanisa nū mulī Kilisito Yesu, kūshisha shibyalīlwe shose sha shiku jose: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
